$ fake_git commit --help
usage:  fake_git commit [--message value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Commit changes to the current branch

Optional switches:
   --message value, -m value
    Commit message
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version

Examples:
   fake_git --help
   fake_git init
   fake_git commit -m "fix bug #1"
   fake_git tag -a "v2.1.5"
